[h1]Ox Here![/h1]
[h2]牛来！[/h2]

[b]When tigers, leopards, and jackals close in, call for an ox.[/b]
[b]当虎豹豺狼逼近时，就喊一声“牛来”。[/b]

Version 1.0.2 · CK3 1.19.0.6

[b]1.0.2 fix:[/b] Fixed raw localization keys appearing in the native hover tooltips for both decision options.
[i]1.0.2 修复：决议两个选项的原生悬浮提示不再显示 raw localization key。[/i]

[h1]A Standalone Decision / 独立决议[/h1]

As a married ruler, open the Decisions panel and choose “Ox Here!” The “Mother...” option summons one exceptional warrior; “I'd rather leopard them” does exactly nothing.
作为已婚统治者，在决议面板中选择【牛来】。【妈妈……】会召来一名强悍勇士；【我宁可跟他们豹拉】则什么也不会发生。

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/f0f6066e44c76f3f78fd10bc28e2c90e45681df7/workshop/ox_here_media/01_decision_options.jpg[/img]

[h1]The Warrior / 这名勇士[/h1]

[list]
[*]Male, age 25–35, with 40–60 generated Prowess and 46–66 final displayed Prowess / 男性，25–35 岁，生成勇武 40–60，最终显示勇武 46–66
[*]Giant and Fecund / 拥有巨人与多产特质
[*]Created from a custom African-blond portrait template, then restored to vanilla Kanuri culture / 生成肖像时使用自定义非洲金发模板，随后恢复为原版卡努里文化
[*]Delivered to your court and forcibly available as a Knight / 立即成为你的廷臣，并被强制列为骑士
[*]If Royal Court is available and Champion is vacant, appointed immediately at zero salary / 如果拥有《皇家宫廷》且勇士职位空缺，会立即零薪任命为勇士
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/f0f6066e44c76f3f78fd10bc28e2c90e45681df7/workshop/ox_here_media/03_warrior_portrait.jpg[/img]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/f0f6066e44c76f3f78fd10bc28e2c90e45681df7/workshop/ox_here_media/04_champion_appointment.jpg[/img]

Every living adult consort becomes the new warrior's secret lover, while that consort's existing lover or soulmate relation with the ruler is removed. The warrior then begins a Seduce scheme against the ruler without a gender or sexual-orientation gate.
每一名在世成年配偶或侧室都会成为新勇士的秘密情人；该配偶与统治者原有的情人或灵魂伴侣关系会被解除。随后，勇士会不受性别或性取向限制地对统治者发起勾引阴谋。

Human players receive a portrait-led arrival event naming exactly who answered the decision: “Did I just hear you say, 'Ox, come?'” It confirms that he joined the court, became a Knight, and—when applicable—was appointed Champion at no salary.
真人玩家会收到带姓名和肖像的到庭事件：“我听到你刚刚说，牛来？”事件会明确确认他已成为廷臣和骑士，并在适用时确认他已零薪担任勇士。

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/f0f6066e44c76f3f78fd10bc28e2c90e45681df7/workshop/ox_here_media/02_arrival_event.jpg[/img]

[h1]AI Policy / AI 规则[/h1]

AI rulers may use this decision, intentionally at low willingness. Base willingness is zero; it rises only for a Knight shortage or a desperate primary war. Even then, recruitment receives only 5 or 25 weight against 100 for declining. Every title tier checks once every 12 months, and every AI use applies an exact one-year cooldown. That cooldown is a hard maximum and must never exceed one year.
AI 统治者可以使用该决议，但意愿被刻意设置得很低。基础意愿为 0，只会在骑士不足或作为主要参战方陷入绝境战争时增加。即便命中需求，招募项也只有 5 或 25 权重，而拒绝项为 100。所有头衔层级每 12 个月检查一次，AI 每次使用后都获得恰好 1 年冷却。这是不得超过 1 年的硬上限。

[h1]Localization / 本地化[/h1]

English / 简体中文 / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español

The seven additional release languages were generated as MiniMax-M3 candidates and then reviewed and corrected by the current model for meaning, terminology, protected tokens, and CK3 format. This is model-led release review, not native-speaker certification.
七种新增发布语言先由 MiniMax-M3 产出候选翻译，再由当前模型逐条审核并修正语义、术语、保护 token 与 CK3 格式。这是模型代行的发布审核，不冒充母语译者认证。

[h1]Compatibility / 兼容性[/h1]

Tested on CK3 1.19.0.6 in an isolated, non-debug game session. This is a standalone mod; Royal Court is optional and only affects automatic Champion appointment. A new single-player game is recommended. Compatibility with other mods defining the same keys is not guaranteed.
已在 CK3 1.19.0.6 的隔离、非调试实机会话中验收。这是独立 mod；《皇家宫廷》只影响自动任命勇士，不是必需条件。推荐新开单人存档。其他 mod 如果定义同名键，不作兼容保证。

